<title>YUGOSLAVIA: SOCCER-YUGOSLAV CUP FINAL FIRST LEG RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YUGOSLAV CUP FINAL FIRST LEG RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NOVI SAD, Yugoslavia 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vojvodina Novi Sad and Red Star Belgrade drew 0-0 in the first leg of the Yugoslav Cup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The return leg in Belgrade is on May 21.</p>
</text>
